{"version":1,"content":"<p>加沙至今戰火未息，當地已淪為廢墟。</p><p>儘管環境惡劣，加沙一班跆拳道兒童運動員近日重新投入訓練，他們在教練帶領下，在戰火瓦礫旁的空地練習，希望有一日能參加國際比賽。</p><p>（法新社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T11:19:08.073051+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T10:38:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T22:57:36.501620+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T11:17:37.008712+00:00","content_hash":"4feed0bef474048963cfb4b75cb9f923f6639428dc69728c3945ba1a6fc25421","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}